  "body": "The [IDL for Document.open(url, name, features)](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#the-document-object) states it returns a `WindowProxy`, and the [steps](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dynamic-markup-insertion.html#dom-document-open-window) say that it should return the result of running the window open steps with *url, name, features*.\r\n\r\nHowever, the [IDL for Window.open(url, target, features)](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/window-object.html#the-window-object) states that it returns a nullable `WindowProxy`, and the [window open steps](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/window-object.html#window-open-steps) return null through a few paths (If *target browsing context* is null or *noopener* is null).\r\n\r\nDoes it make sense for Document.open(url, name, features) to return a nullable WindowProxy?",
